#: ../../../source/api/codegen/index.rst:2
msgid "Code generation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/api/codegen/index.rst:4
msgid "PyBaMM evaluates CasADi expressions through one of two backends:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/api/codegen/index.rst:6
msgid "``compile=False`` (default) -- CasADi's in-process virtual machine."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/api/codegen/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"``compile=True`` -- :func:`pybamm.codegen.compilation.aot_compile` emits C "
"source for a CasADi ``Function``, compiles it to a shared library and "
"returns a ``casadi.external`` wrapper. Results are cached in-process and on "
"disk, keyed by a hash of the serialised function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/api/codegen/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"The backend is selected via the ``compile`` option on a solver, e.g. "
"``pybamm.IDAKLUSolver(options={\"compile\": True})``. The setting is "
"forwarded to :class:`pybamm.Solution` so post-solve variable observation "
"uses the same backend as the integration."
msgstr ""
